#-------------------------
# Hramatyka opysu kimnaty
#-------------------------

# Frahmenty Inform7
#-------------------
# Ne povynno vynykaty potreby zminiuvaty tse. Tse skorochennia dlia vypadkiv,
# koly potribno vykorystaty kod i7. Ymovirno, pohana ideia vkliuchaty siudy
# symvoly abo tokeny.
i7_closed/open:[if (obj) is open]vidkrytyi[otherwise]zakrytyi[end if]
i7_list_in:[spysok predmetiv u (obj)]
i7_list_on:[spysok predmetiv na (obj)]
i7_empty:[if (obj) contains nothing]porozhnii[otherwise]neporozhnii[end if]
inform7:[if (obj) is locked]zamknenyi[else if (obj) is open]vidkrytyi[otherwise]zakrytyi[end if]
inform7A:[if (obj) is locked]Zamknenyi[else if (obj) is open]Vidkrytyi[otherwise]Zakrytyi[end if]
inform7noa:[if (obj) is locked]zamknenyi[else if (obj) is open]vidkrytyi[otherwise]zakrytyi[end if]
inform7noun:[if (obj) is locked]zamknenyi[else if (obj) is open]vidkrytyi[otherwise]zakrytyi[end if]
inform7nounnoa:[if (obj) is locked]zamknenyi[else if (obj) is open]vidkrytyi[otherwise]zakrytyi[end if]

# Vstup do kimnaty
#----------------
# Tekst dlia predstavlennia kimnaty. Napryklad:
# "Vitaiemo, vy zaraz u hariachii kukhni"
# dec:[if unvisited]#GREETING!# #dec_type##suffix_(r)#[otherwise]#revisit#[end if];
# [if unvisited]#dec_type##suffix_(r)#[otherwise]#revisit#[end if]
dec:#dec_type##suffix_(r)#

### Pershyi raz u kimnati ###

dec_type:#reg-0#;#normal-0#;#difficult-0#;#moredifficult-0#;#playful-0#
reg-0:#04#;#05#;#06#
normal-0:#07#
difficult-0:#016#
moredifficult-0:#017#
playful-0:#01#;#02#;#03#;#08#;#09#;#010#;#011#;#012#;#013#;#014#;#015#;#018#;#019#;#020#;#021#;#022#;#023#;#024#;#025#;#026#;#027#;#028#

### Povtornyi vkhid do kimnaty ###

revisit:Vy znovu uviishly do (name).;Vy znovu vkhodyte do (name). Vy taki rozghubleni, shcho vam potribno nahadaty, shcho ye v kimnati, khocha vy buly tut lyshe kilka sekund tomu.;Shcho, vy dumaly, shcho yakshcho pidete kudys i povernetesia, tse mistse perestane buty (name)?;A, (name). U vas bahato chudovykh spohadiv pro tse mistse. Svizhykh spohadiv. Vy buly tut lyshe sekundu tomu.;Nu os vy y povernulysia do (name).;Shchoino vy podumaly, shcho bilshe nikoly ne pobachyte (name), yak znovu povertaietesia siudy.;Laskavo prosymo nazad do (name).

# Shablony vstupu do kimnaty
#--------------------------

01:Meni shkoda povidomliaty, ale teper vy perebuvaiete v (name)
02:A, (name-n). Tse yakyis (name-n), spravdi chudova atmosfera (name-adj) u tsomu mistsi, chudova (name-adj) atmosfera. I teper, nu, vy v nomu
03:Harazd, otzhe, vy v (name-n), kruto, ale chy vin (name-adj)? Shche b pak
04:#dec_find-yourself# u (name);#dec_guess-what# (name)
05:Nu os my y opynylysia v #dec_a_the# (name)
06:Teper vy v #dec_a_the# (name)
07:Vy uviishly do (name);Vy shchoino #dec_walked_into# (name)
08:Tse mozhe staty dlia vas shokom, ale vy shchoino #dec_entered# (name)
09:Ya #announce_mood# povidomyty, shcho teper vy perebuvaiete v (name)
010:A, (name-n). Tse yakyis (name-n), spravdi chudova atmosfera (name-adj) u tsomu mistsi, chudova (name-adj) atmosfera
011:Vy #dec_entered# do nai(name-adj)nishoho z usikh mozhlyvykh (name-n)
012:Z usikh (name-n), do yakykh vy mohly #dec_walked_into#, vam dovelosia #dec_walk_into# same do (name-adj)
013:Vy #dec_entered# do (name-n). Ne do toho (name-n), yakoho vy ochikuvaly. Ni, tse (name)
014:Vy perebuvaiete v (name-n). Skhozhe, tut dosyt (name-adj)
015:Vy #dec_what# u mistsi, yake mozhna nazvaty (name-adj). Tobto vy perebuvaiete v (name-n)
016:#dec_find-yourself# u (name-n). Dosyt (name-adj)
017:#dec_find-yourself# u (name-n). Take sobi (name-adj) mistse
018:#017#
019:Vy #dec_entered# do (name-adj) kimnaty. Vash rozum hariachkovo namahaietsia prydumaty, yaka kimnata mohla b buty (name-adj). I tut vas osiaiuie. Zvychaino. Vy v (name)
020:Yakshcho vam tsikavo, chomu raptom use zdaietsia takym (name-adj), tse tomu, shcho vy shchoino #dec_walked_into# do (name)
021:Yaka nespodivana zustrich. Tut, do rechi, — tse (name);Ya nikoly ne vvazhav vas liudynoiu, yaka z'yavytsia v (name), ale, skhozhe, ya pomyliavsia
022:Tse zvuchatyme neimovirno, ale vy shchoino uviishly do (name);Vy ne poviryte, ale vy shchoino uviishly do (name)
023:Vy robyte hrandioznyi ekstsentrychnyi vkhid do (name);Vy robyte shche odyn zi svoikh hrandioznykh ekstsentrychnykh vkhodiv do (name)
024:Podyvitsia na sebe, velykyi bos, yakyi zakhodyt u (name), niby tse ne yakas velychezna podiia
025:Ozyrnitsia navkolo. Otsinit use tse. Ne shchodnia komus vypadaie pobuvaty v (name)
026:Vy bachyly y krashchi (name-n), ale prynaimni tsei zdaietsia dosyt (name-adj);Ya prosto vvazhaiu chudovym, shcho vy zaraz u (name);Ya prosto vvazhaiu chudovym, shcho vy shchoino uviishly do (name)
027:#signquality# #sign# povidomliaie vam, shcho teper vy perebuvaiete v (name);Pohliante na tsei #sign#! Shcho tam napysano? Tam napysano «Laskavo prosymo do (name)»? Nu, tse kruto
028:Shchoino nadiishla novyna — vy, u (name);Laskavo prosymo do (name);Oho! Vy v (name);Nu os my y u (name);Vy uviishly do (name);Tsei (name-n), do yakoho vy shchoino uviishly, bezumovno ye (name-adj)

