#------------------------------------------

GREETING!:VITAIeMO!;VITAIu!;PRYVIT!;OTZhE, POChNEMO!
dec_entered:uviishly;zaishly;vpaly;peremistylysia;vvalylysia;potrapyly
dec_find-yourself:Vy #dec_what#
dec_guess-what:#dec_well-guess#, vy perebuvaiete v #dec_a_the# mistsi, yake my nazyvaiemo #dec_a_the#
dec_well-guess:Vhadaite shcho;Nu os yak;Nu, khto b mih podumaty
dec_what:ye;opyniaietes;prybuvaiete
dec_a_the:a;tse
dec_in_at:u;v
dec_walk_into:uviity;zaity;proity;prohuliatysia do
dec_walked_into:uviishly;zaishly;proishly
announce_mood:shkoda;radyi;skhvylovanyi;u zakhvati;duzhe shchaslyvyi;maiu chest;zmushenyi;zobov'yazanyi
signquality:zanedbanyi;irzhavyi;laminovanyi;kryvyi;dobre obramlenyi
sign:znak;plakat;oholoshennia;tablychka;doshka

# Rozdiliuvachi opysiv
#------------------
# Vykorystovuiutsia dlia rozdilennia opysiv riznykh typiv ob'yektiv

#First
#first:Spochatku vy shukaiete (next object type);Spochatku vy ohliadaiete kimnatu v poshukakh (next object type);Spochatku vy ohliadaiete kimnatu, shukaiuchy (next object type)
#Middle
#middle:Pislia tsoho vy shukaiete (next object type);Pislia toho yak vy vyznachyly kilkist (previous object type), vy pochynaiete shukaty (next object type);
#Last
#last:i nareshti vy pereviriaiete (next object type)

# Opys konteineriv
#----------------
# Pravyla opysu konteineriv
# room_desc_(c): heneruie vsi opysy konteineriv
# containerdescription: mistyt usi opysy zovnishnoho vyhliadu konteineriv
# room_desc_(c)_1_name: opysuie konteiner yak prykmetnyk+imennyk
# room_dec_(c)_1_noun: opysuie konteiner yak imennyk
# room_desc_(c)_content: vyznachaie, chy potribno dodaty opys vmistu konteinera zalezhno vid toho, chy vin vidkrytyi
# opencontainer: te, shcho dodaietsia, yakshcho konteiner vidkrytyi
# room_desc_(c)_2_adj: dodaie prykmetnyk i spysok vmistu
# room_desc_(c)_2: spysok vmistu bez prykmetnyka

room_desc_(c):#containerdescription##room_desc_(c)_content#
#special_container#.

containerdescription:#room_desc_(c)_1_name#;#room_desc_(c)_1_noun#

room_desc_(c)_content:[if (obj) is open and there is something in the (obj)] #opencontainer##suffix#[end if][if (obj) is open and the (obj) contains nothing] #emptyreaction#[end if]

