room_desc_(s)_multi_adj:[if there is something on the (obj)]Na (name-adj) vy bachyte #i7_list_on##suffix_(s)_end#[end if][if there is nothing on the (obj)]#emptysupporter_multi##suffix_(s)_end_angry#[end if]

